      "found_by": [
        "llm-atomic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_range": "L276-277",
      "text": "The `stickiness` target group property, if enabled (for ALBs only), uses a cookie to ensure traffic consistently flows to the same targets, provided they remain active.",
