      "found_by": [
        "llm-atomic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_range": "L279-283",
      "text": "The `targetType` target group property's possible values are `instance` (an EC2 instance ID), `ip` (an IP address), `lambda` (a Lambda function), and `alb` (an Application Load Balancer).",
